{"id":"n81341-1-5","stage":4,"title":"콧등 · 鼻梁","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81341-1-5-1","ko":"콧등에 자국이 생겼네?","zh":"鼻梁上怎么有印子啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"콧등에","meaning":"鼻梁","explanation":"콧등：鼻梁；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"콧등","audio":"/audio/dcdb804102f91905679c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81341","senseId":"1","lemma":"콧등","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"콧등에","audio":"/audio/04a581bf79472413fe7b.mp3"}},{"text":"자국이","meaning":"痕迹","explanation":"자국：痕迹；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"자국","audio":"/audio/0d781af131d0d7e0b149.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90333","senseId":"1","lemma":"자국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자국이","audio":"/audio/f07d0aa022a8c21fbe3e.mp3"}},{"text":"생겼네?","meaning":"有，出现","explanation":"생기다：有，出现；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"1","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생겼네","audio":"/audio/29a9abf3f4a74bd10c87.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dcdb804102f91905","term":"콧등","zh":"鼻梁","audio":"/audio/dcdb804102f91905679c.mp3","entryId":"81341","definition":"鼻子隆起的部分。","pronunciation":["코뜽","콛뜽"]},{"id":"0d781af131d0d7e0","term":"자국","zh":"痕迹","audio":"/audio/0d781af131d0d7e0b149.mp3","entryId":"90333","definition":"别的东西触碰或沾贴而产生的形迹；或指由于受某事物的影响，原物变形的印痕。","pronunciation":["자국"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"有，出现","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"新增了原本没有的东西。","pronunciation":["생기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/427299c121e41105c7a7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81341-1-5-2","ko":"안경을 오래 써서 그런가 보다.","zh":"大概是戴眼镜戴太久了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"안경을","meaning":"眼镜","explanation":"안경：眼镜；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"안경","audio":"/audio/7c40f615a28bcb4a9828.m